OL,3,GNEWSARiver recovery brings hope for
OL,4,AAtlantic salmon
OL,5,
OL,6,FEfforts to improve the quality of
OL,7,FLancashire's rivers are "paying off",
OL,8,Fconservationists have said, with
OL,9,Fresearch suggesting Atlantic salmon are
OL,10,Fmaking a comeback in the county.
OL,12,FEvery year, the Ribble Rivers Trust
OL,13,Fsurveys more than 300 sites across the
OL,14,FRibble catchment area, including the
OL,15,FRivers Ribble, Hodder, Calder, Darwen
OL,16,Fand Douglas, along with their
OL,17,Ftributaries.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
