OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSARiver recovery brings hope for
OL,4,AAtlantic salmon
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt one site, more than 100 juvenile
OL,7,FAtlantic salmon were recorded in a few
OL,8,Fminutes this year while another
OL,9,Flocation had its first salmon sightings
OL,10,Fin more than a decade.
OL,12,FThe significant improvement reverses
OL,13,Fseveral years of disappointing returns.
OL,14,FThe trust said this "cracking bit of
OL,15,Fnews... gives us real hope for the
OL,16,Ffuture".
